        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A pathologic primary tumor stage for ovary according to AJCC 7th edition indicating that the tumor has extension and/or implants on uterus and/or tube(s) and no malignant cells in ascites or peritoneal washings.</obo:IAO_0000115>
