        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A pathologic primary tumor stage for ovary according to AJCC 7th edition indicating that the tumor has peritoneal metastasis beyond pelvis, more than 2 cm in greatest dimension and/or regional lymph node metastasis.</obo:IAO_0000115>
